# SPIKE to Production Transition Rules

Prevents SPIKE code from becoming production code. Enforces refactoring phase.

## When to Apply

Apply this rule when:
- SPIKE code is detected (comments, patterns, time-boxed development)
- Code marked with "SPIKE" comment
- Quick implementations that need refactoring
- Time-boxed exploration code

## Lambda Engine Mode

**Mode 1 (Duality Navigation)** - Stable refactoring patterns

